# Game Informer

> Game Informer is a video game publication covering news, reviews, previews, features, videos, podcasts, release schedules, and Game Informer Magazine archives. Use this file as a concise map of the public site for search, citation, and AI-assisted discovery.

Last reviewed: 2026-06-22
Canonical host: https://gameinformer.com

Access notes:

- Respect [robots.txt](https://gameinformer.com/robots.txt) and its Content-Signal directives.
- Prefer canonical URLs on `https://gameinformer.com` rather than `https://www.gameinformer.com`.
- Prefer linked article pages, RSS feeds, and the XML sitemap over JavaScript-rendered navigation.
- Do not use account, cart, checkout, newsletter-management, admin, or search-result pages as source material.
- Do not use `/cdn-cgi`, `/async-load`, `/gi-growthbook`, `/darkmode`, or other utility endpoints as source material.

